   "native_decoder": "Read complete_parent_assembly.word in order as layers; center their summed full thicknesses in z. Read each layer.rows.word in order as complete module rows, centered together in y. A row has module_count identical whole patches centered in x, spaced by its full width. For each a by b patch use local owner centers(pitch*u,period*(v+(u mod2)/2),0)minus midpoint((a-1)*pitch/2,(b-1+epsilon/2)*period/2,0), epsilon=(a>1). Act on local centers by the stored proper module quaternion. The actual owner quaternion is module_quaternion*ideal_origin_quaternion_native. Keep precisely retained_owner_words, multiply all centers by1.0000001, and inflate the common nominal host by that factor plus1e-7.",
